  "motion": {
    "frames": 160,
    "note": "ours, modelled on Showdown's normal Dragalge (an underwater sway, 79-frame cycle): 160 frames = 4.8 s, two 80-frame sways - the body rolls SWAY deg, the head lags against it, the fin-wings ripple from root to tip (FIN deg, a lag per segment), the dangling feelers and tail trail behind. Signature fin flare, frames 96-144: the head rears, the wings sweep up LIFT deg, beat down once (BEAT) and settle; drawn per frame (style.fast_frames)"
  },
